      "id": 5695,
      "name": "Koga",
      "username": "Koga",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-30T03:36:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Decided to make my own custom hero recently so I’ve been searching the web to find the correct fonts and finally found them, all made by the same person, Nate Piekos (blambot). These are the same fonts used on the SotM cards. Decided I’d share this discovery with everyone here in case they want to make thier own custom heroes, like when Richard Launius first made his custom NightMist before he joined up for Infernal Relics.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.blambot.com\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></a></p>\n<p>These are all free fonts too.<br>\nSC logo = <a href=\"http://www.blambot.com/font_detectivesinc.shtml\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Detectives, Inc</a><br>\nHero/Villain HP &amp; Villain Names = <a href=\"http://www.blambot.com/font_armorpiercing.shtml\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Armor Piercing</a><br>\nCard Headers &amp; HP = <a href=\"http://www.blambot.com/font_crashlanding.shtml\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Crash Landing</a><br>\nCard Text = <a href=\"http://www.blambot.com/font_rsbs.shtml\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Red State Blue State</a></p>\n<p>Here’s a place you can easily search through the free fonts and even see what your own words will look like before you download.<br>\n<a href=\"http://www.fontspace.com/blambot\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.fontspace.com/blambot</a></p>\n<p>P.S. Just realized I could now make my own SotM cover for the box I currently put all my cards in, since I now have the fonts.</p>",
